        <title>Using ChatGPT to Write a Script for Generating Chinese Subtitles for Video Files</title>
        <link>https://gowinder.work/en/use-chatgpt-to-make-a-sub-generator-script/</link>
        <pubDate>Wed, 06 Mar 2024 14:40:28 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://gowinder.work/en/use-chatgpt-to-make-a-sub-generator-script/</guid>
        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;using-chatgpt-to-write-a-script-for-generating-chinese-subtitles-for-video-files&#34;&gt;Using ChatGPT to Write a Script for Generating Chinese Subtitles for Video Files
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;background&#34;&gt;Background
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For some obscure movies or videos, it is hard to find Chinese subtitles even though they have a plot, so in these cases you have to add Chinese subtitles manually. But adding Chinese subtitles by hand is extremely time-consuming, especially for long videos. So I wanted to use ChatGPT to help me write a script that can automatically generate Chinese subtitles for video files.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
        </item>
        <item>
        <title>Class Constructor TypeOrmCrudService Cannot Be Invoked Without &#39;New&#39;</title>
        <link>https://gowinder.work/en/class-constructor-typeormcrudservice-cannot-be-invoked-without-new/</link>
        <pubDate>Tue, 28 Feb 2023 11:08:03 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://gowinder.work/en/class-constructor-typeormcrudservice-cannot-be-invoked-without-new/</guid>
        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;class-constructor-typeormcrudservice-cannot-be-invoked-without-new-error&#34;&gt;Class Constructor TypeOrmCrudService Cannot Be Invoked Without &amp;lsquo;New&amp;rsquo; Error
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;cause&#34;&gt;Cause
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recently I was developing a &lt;code&gt;chatgpt&lt;/code&gt; gateway project using &lt;code&gt;nestjs&lt;/code&gt;, with &lt;code&gt;nestjsx-crud&lt;/code&gt; to speed up &lt;code&gt;curd&lt;/code&gt; development, and I had the following code:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-typescript&#34; data-lang=&#34;typescript&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;@Injectable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;ChatgptAccountService&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;extends&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;TypeOrmCrudService&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;ChatGPTAccount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;constructor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;@InjectRepository&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;ChatGPTAccount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;private&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;readonly&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;chatgptAccountRepository&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&#34;kt&#34;&gt;Repository&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;ChatGPTAccount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;super&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;chatgptAccountRepository&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At runtime it threw the error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Class Constructor TypeOrmCrudService Cannot Be Invoked Without &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;New&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;solution&#34;&gt;Solution
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;I looked it up online and found one &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/nestjsx/crud/issues/378#issuecomment-764648149&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;here&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;code&gt;For anyone stumbling over this issue: it&#39;s probably a tsconfig issue. Try bumping your target from es5 to es6.&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
        </item>
        
